     "id": "12c29ffa",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">Go Turf is the Sunshine Coast’s premier turf farm. It is a family run business located on the Pumicestone Passage with spectacular views of the Glasshouse Mountains. With a range of turf on offer, delivery and installation is all taken care of.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">Carrying out several shoot days over the past 4 years, the footage and images shot by Pepper Productions have showcased the Go Turf family, farm, machinery, fertilisers and not forgetting their stunning range of turf. It is always a pleasure to spend a day on the Go Turf Farm.</p>",
      "text_color": "#55575C",
